"version": "1",
"text": "Your outfit is built around the soft drape of the black floral chiffon dress, which flows elegantly over your body without clinging to the waist. The black t-shirt can be layered underneath or worn off-shoulder for a relaxed, modern edge depending on how you want to feel. The black mules add a sleek contrast with their smooth leather finish and square silhouette, keeping your look grounded yet chic. A gold chain necklace adds subtle shimmer that catches the light, perfect for evening ambiance, while the orange crossbody bag injects warmth and a pop of color that draws attention to your frame.",
"how_to_wear": [
"Let the chiffon skirt move freely with you as you dance — it sways beautifully without restricting your motion."
],
